[FINAL-TEXT] This is the conclusive evidence I needed. Every OSPF neighbor across the entire topology shows **exactly 6 state changes**, all occurring ~7 minutes ago, with **no state change since then**. Six state changes is the exact normal OSPF progression: Down → Init → 2-Way → ExStart → Exchange → Loading → Full. The FRR log contains only 10 lines — the startup entries and two initial negotiation events. There is no evidence of any subsequent adjacency drop or bounce anywhere in the lab.

